  "Z_tex": "Z = \\tfrac12\\big(Z_{1,1}+Z_{1,C}+Z_{C,1}+Z_{C,C}\\big) = \\sum_{C\\text{-orbits}} \\chi_{(\\lambda;\\mu)}\\overline{\\chi_{(\\lambda^*;\\mu)}} + \\sum_{\\text{fixed}}\\big(|\\chi^+|^2+|\\chi^-|^2\\big) + \\sum_r \\big(|\\mathcal{T}^+_r|^2+|\\mathcal{T}^-_r|^2\\big)",
  "character_tex": "Frenkel-Kac-Wakimoto characters $\\chi_{(\\lambda;\\mu)} = \\eta(\\tau)^{-2}\\sum_{w\\in W(A_2)}\\epsilon(w)\\sum_{\\alpha\\in Q} q^{|p'(\\lambda+\\rho)-p\\,w(\\mu+\\rho)+pp'\\alpha|^2/2pp'}$, $p'=p+1$, with $\\lambda = (\\lambda_1,\\lambda_2)$ a level-$(p-3)$ and $\\mu = (\\mu_1,\\mu_2)$ a level-$(p-2)$ $SU(3)$ weight in Dynkin labels, $(\\lambda;\\mu)\\sim(\\sigma\\lambda;\\sigma\\mu)$ under the $\\mathbb{Z}_3$ rotation of affine Dynkin labels; $h = \\frac{|p'(\\lambda+\\rho)-p(\\mu+\\rho)|^2-|\\rho|^2}{2pp'}$. On a self-conjugate field ($\\lambda+\\rho = a\\rho$, $\\mu+\\rho = b\\rho$) the $C$-twined character is $t_{a,b} = \\eta(2\\tau)^{-1}\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb{Z}}\\big(q^{(p'a-pb+pp'n)^2/pp'}-q^{(p'a+pb+pp'n)^2/pp'}\\big)$ and $\\chi^{\\pm} = \\frac12(\\chi\\pm t_{a,b})$. Twisted characters (Poisson resummation of $t_{a,b}$): $\\mathcal{T}_r = \\eta(\\tau/2)^{-1}\\big(\\sum_{x\\equiv r\\ (pp')}-\\sum_{x\\equiv r^*\\ (pp')}\\big)\\,q^{x^2/4pp'}$ with $r^*\\equiv r$ mod $p$, $r^*\\equiv -r$ mod $p'$, of weight $h_r = \\frac1{16}+\\frac{r^2-4}{4pp'}$; $\\mathcal{T}^{\\pm}_r$ are its parts with $L_0-h_r$ in $\\mathbb{Z}$ and $\\mathbb{Z}+\\frac12$. Here $p = 6$ and $(r,r^*) \\in \\{(1,13), (2,26), (4,10), (5,23), (8,20), (11,17)\\}$.",
  "description": "Orbifold of $\\mathcal{W}_3(6,7)^{C_a}$ by charge conjugation $C: W\\to -W$, $(\\lambda;\\mu)\\mapsto(\\lambda^*;\\mu^*)$ (Dijkgraaf-Vafa-Verlinde-Verlinde 1989). The untwisted sector keeps one copy of each $C$-orbit of terms and the $C$-even parts of the 6 terms on self-conjugate fields ($C = +1$ on their primaries, the only choice whose twisted sector has non-negative integer multiplicities and spins in $\\frac12\\mathbb{Z}$); the twisted sector $\\sum_r|\\mathcal{T}_r|^2$ is the Poisson resummation of $Z_{1,C} = \\sum|t_{a,b}|^2$, projected to integer spin.",
